#+TITLE: Owned CAD disappearance incorrectly accepted an abnormal native exit
#+STATUS: DONE
#+PRIORITY: P1
#+TYPE: bug
#+BRANCH: codex/alfe-restore-error-detail

* Evidence
SCHME job 571171 passed 23 tests and RESTORED/close-owned.result0 but its retained
native process handle reported 3221226356 (C0000374), PID12788,
creation ticks639294764853052918. The log path was valid and isolated.

* Resolution in 2.3.97
Validate SID/session/creation identity, retain a kernel handle before requesting
Quit, wait for that incarnation to signal and require native exit zero. Persist
the exact code; release the handle on every path. Tests inject zero, C0000374,
C0000005 and STILL_ACTIVE and assert opener-before-close plus release-on-failure.
This fixes false acceptance, not the originating native heap corruption.
